My doctor asked what I was doing differently. I said 'eating tar from the Himalayas.' He did not laugh.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggk5LbXatBy_text","label":"ggk5LbXatBy_text","default":"<p>T-levels up 23% in 90 days. No injections, no prescription. My wife says I'm 'annoyingly energetic' now. I'll take it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggU_N-qYNiq_text","label":"ggU_N-qYNiq_text","default":"<p><strong>- James K., 61, Phoenix AZ&nbsp;</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRbExvtONZ_text","label":"ggRbExvtONZ_text","default":"<p>\"I initiated on a Tuesday. We never do anything on Tuesdays. She was suspicious.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOoIsYHixw_text","label":"ggOoIsYHixw_text","default":"<p>She literally asked if I was having an affair. Nope. Just finally feel like myself again. Like the guy she married.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLThJwXJb3_text","label":"ggLThJwXJb3_text","default":"<p><strong>- Michael T., 52, Denver CO</strong></p>"}],
